T* (UNIT TEST REPORT) Tj
T* (1. Overview) Tj
T* (This report records the repository's automated backend unit-test suite.) Tj
T* (Project: Railway Reservation System) Tj
T* (Branch: main) Tj
T* (Test framework: Python unittest) Tj
T* (Coverage tool: coverage.py with branch coverage) Tj
T* (CI platform: GitHub Actions \(workflow: Tests\)) Tj
T* (2. Scope) Tj
T* (Tests are maintained under backend/tests/test_*.py.) Tj
T* (Covered areas include registration, login, admin authorization,) Tj
T* (train search, seat availability, fare calculation, passenger details,) Tj
T* (booking creation, payments, cancellations, refunds, booking history,) Tj
T* (schedule and seat administration, configuration and API security.) Tj
T* (3. Execution method) Tj
T* (GitHub Actions runs the suite using:) Tj
T* (python -m coverage run --branch --source=backend/app,backend/config) Tj
T* (  -m unittest discover -s backend/tests -p test_*.py -v) Tj
T* (It then generates coverage report, JSON and XML outputs.) Tj
T* (4. Verified execution evidence) Tj
